<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1D">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "04">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1426059" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Intake VVT Actuator Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The intake VVT actuator will lose its original performance if it is disassembled.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not disassemble and repair the intake VVT actuator. If any faulty condition is found, replace the intake VVT actuator with a new one.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1426059001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine assembly from vehicle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426025"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect intake VVT actuator connector.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intake VVT actuator (motor part) (1) and O-ring.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142074.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.768mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426033"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
With hexagonal section of intake camshaft held stationary with spanner or adjustable wrench (1), remove intake VVT actuator bolt (2) and remove intake VVT actuator (sprocket part) (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142075.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.022mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1426059002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Fit intake VVT actuator (sprocket part) to intake camshaft.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
With hexagonal section of intake camshaft held stationary with spanner or adjustable wrench (1), tighten intake VVT actuator (sprocket part) bolt (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D259">
<t-part>
Intake VVT actuator (sprocket part) bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
90
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
9.2
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
66.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142076.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.022mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426033"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clean mating surface of oil pump assembly, fit new O-rings to oil pump assembly.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install intake VVT actuator (motor part) (1) to oil pump assembly (2) aligning intake VVT actuator (motor part) coupling (3) with slit (4) of intake VVT actuator (sprocket part).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142077.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "61.567mm" ver = "01" gw = "186" gh = "158"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten intake VVT actuator (motor part) bolts (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D260">
<t-part>
Intake VVT actuator (motor part) bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
25
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.5
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
18.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142078.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.768mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect intake VVT actuator connector.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install engine assembly from vehicle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426025"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clear DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1124004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
